id: refusal/bad-file
name: File trouble reported briefly and clearly
prose: |
  A missing or unreadable file, a file that is not a picture at all, a picture in another format than JPEG, and a picture too small to search (a side shorter than two pixels) are each refused with a one-line English error and a nonzero exit.
scope:
- src/**
- Cargo.toml
- Cargo.lock
- build
- materials/notpic.jpg
- materials/picture.png
- materials/tiny.jpg
covers:
- R1
- R2
- R3
- R4
rows:
- run: ./brim detect materials/missing.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 1
- run: ./brim detect materials/notpic.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 1
- run: ./brim detect materials/picture.png
  expect:
    rc: 1
- run: ./brim detect materials/tiny.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 1
